    rdfs:seeAlso <https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-94127> ;
    skos:definition "F5 BIG-IP APM contains a heap-based buffer overflow vulnerability when access policy and an OAuth profile are configured on a virtual server. This vulnerability could allow an unauthenticated attacker to perform remote code execution."@en ;
